    "description": {
      "value": "When you pull up the hood of this nondescript gray cloak (an Interact action), you become drab and uninteresting, gaining a +1 item bonus to Stealth checks and to Deception checks to Impersonate a forgettable background character, such as a servant, but also taking a \u20131 item penalty to Diplomacy and Intimidation checks.\n\n- **Activate:** 2 Actions\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n\nYou pull the cloak's hood up and gain the benefits of nondetection for 1 hour or until you pull the hood back down, whichever comes first."
    },
